#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:8
msgid "Archive a channel"
msgstr "채널 보관"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:10
msgid ""
"Delete :ref:`public channels <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:public channels>` and :ref:`private channels <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/channel-types:private channels>` when they're no longer"
" needed by archiving them. Archiving channels removes them from the "
"channel sidebar and marks them as read-only. Anyone can archive a public "
"or private channel they're a member of, unless your system admin has "
":doc:`disabled </administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions>` your"
" ability to do so."
msgstr ""
":ref:`공개 채널 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:public channels>`\\ "
"과 :ref:`비공개 채널 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:private "
"channels>`\\ 이 더 이상 필요하지 않으면 보관하여 삭제하세요. 채널을 보관하면 채널 "
"사이드바에서 제거되고 읽기 전용으로 표시됩니다. 시스템 관리자가 그렇게 할 수 있는 "
"기능을 :doc:`비활성화 </administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions>`\\ "
"하지 않은 한, 누구나 자신이 구성원으로 있는 공개 또는 비공개 채널을 보관할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:14
msgid ""
"You can continue to access archived channels, unless your system admin "
"has :ref:`disabled <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-"
"settings:allow users to view archived channels>` your ability to do so."
msgstr ""
"시스템 관리자가 그렇게 할 수 있는 기능을 :ref:`비활성화 <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:allow users to view archived "
"channels>`\\ 하지 않은 한, 보관된 채널에 계속 액세스할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:18
msgid ""
"To archive a channel, select the channel name at the top of the center "
"pane to access the drop-down menu, then select **Archive Channel**."
msgstr ""
"채널을 보관하려면, 중앙 창 상단의 채널 이름을 선택하여 드롭다운 메뉴에 액세스한 "
"다음 **채널 보관**\\ 을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:22
msgid "To archive a channel:"
msgstr "채널을 보관하려면:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:24
msgid "Tap the channel you want to delete."
msgstr "삭제할 채널을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:26
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:80
msgid "Select a channel that you want to edit."
msgstr "편집할 채널을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:30
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:84
msgid ""
"Tap the **More** |more-icon-vertical| icon located in the top right "
"corner of the app."
msgstr ""
"앱 오른쪽 상단 모서리에 있는 **더 보기** |more-icon-vertical| 아이콘을 "
"탭하세요."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:50
msgid ""
"Use the More icon in the top left corner to access Mattermost desktop "
"apps customization settings."
msgstr ""
"왼쪽 상단 모서리의 더 보기 아이콘을 사용하여 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱 사용자 지정 "
"설정에 액세스하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:32
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:86
msgid "Tap on More options to access available options for the channel."
msgstr "채널에 사용 가능한 옵션에 액세스하려면 더 보기 옵션을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:36
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:90
msgid "Tap **View info**."
msgstr "**정보 보기**\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:38
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:92
msgid "Tap on View info to see the basic channel info."
msgstr "기본 채널 정보를 보려면 정보 보기를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:42
msgid "Tap **Archive Channel**."
msgstr "**채널 보관**\\ 을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:44
msgid "Tap on Archive channel to archive the current channel."
msgstr "현재 채널을 보관하려면 채널 보관을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:48
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:102
msgid "Tap **Yes** to confirm."
msgstr "확인하려면 **예**\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:50
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:104
msgid "Tap on Yes to confirm your choice."
msgstr "선택을 확인하려면 예를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:56
msgid ""
"When a Mattermost user is deactivated in the system, your :ref:`direct "
"message channel <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:direct message "
"channels>` with that user are archived and marked as read-only. An "
"**Archived** icon |file-box| displays next to archived channels. From "
"Mattermost v11.5, archived private channels display a distinct **Archive "
"Lock** icon to differentiate them from other archived channels."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 사용자가 시스템에서 비활성화되면, 해당 사용자와의 :ref:`개인 메시지 채널 "
"<end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:direct message channels>`\\ 이 "
"보관되고 읽기 전용으로 표시됩니다. 보관된 채널 옆에 **보관됨** 아이콘 "
"|file-box|\\ 이 표시됩니다. OKR.BEST v11.5부터, 보관된 비공개 채널은 다른 보관된 "
"채널과 구별하기 위해 별도의 **보관 잠금** 아이콘을 표시합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:28
msgid "Archived channels are identified with a File Box icon."
msgstr "보관된 채널은 파일 상자 아이콘으로 식별됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:57
msgid ""
":ref:`Group message channels <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:group message channels>` can't be archived, but they can be closed "
"to hide them from the channel sidebar."
msgstr ""
":ref:`그룹 메시지 채널 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:group message "
"channels>`\\ 은 보관할 수 없지만, 채널 사이드바에서 숨기도록 닫을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:58
msgid "The default **Town Square** channel can't be archived."
msgstr "기본 **Town Square** 채널은 보관할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:59
msgid ""
"System admins can archive channels without needing to be a channel member"
" by using the System Console."
msgstr ""
"시스템 관리자는 관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널 구성원이 아니어도 채널을 보관할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:60
msgid ""
"Because a copy of the channel exists on the server, you can't reuse the "
"URL of an archived channel when :doc:`creating a new channel </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/create-channels>`."
msgstr ""
"채널의 사본이 서버에 존재하기 때문에, :doc:`새 채널을 만들 </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/create-channels>`\\ 때 보관된 채널의 URL을 재사용할 수 "
"없습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:63
msgid "Unarchive a channel"
msgstr "채널 보관 해제"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:65
msgid ""
"System admins and Team admins can restore archived channels. When a "
"channel is unarchived, channel membership and all its content is "
"restored, unless messages and files have been deleted based on a "
":ref:`data retention policy <administration-guide/configure/compliance-"
"configuration-settings:data retention policies>`."
msgstr ""
"시스템 관리자와 팀 관리자는 보관된 채널을 복원할 수 있습니다. 채널이 보관 해제되면, "
":ref:`데이터 보존 정책 <administration-guide/configure/compliance-"
"configuration-settings:data retention policies>`\\ 에 따라 메시지와 파일이 "
"삭제되지 않은 한, 채널 멤버십과 모든 콘텐츠가 복원됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:69
msgid ""
"Search for the channel if required. Then, open the channel, select the "
"channel name at the top of the center pane to access the drop-down menu "
"and select **Unarchive Channel**."
msgstr ""
"필요한 경우 채널을 검색하세요. 그런 다음 채널을 열고, 중앙 창 상단의 채널 이름을 "
"선택하여 드롭다운 메뉴에 액세스한 다음 **채널 보관 해제**\\ 를 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:71
msgid "Unarchive a channel."
msgstr "채널을 보관 해제하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:76
msgid "To unarchive a channel:"
msgstr "채널을 보관 해제하려면:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:78
msgid "Tap the channel you want to unarchive."
msgstr "보관 해제할 채널을 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:96
msgid "Tap **Unarchive Channel**."
msgstr "**채널 보관 해제**\\ 를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:98
msgid "Tap on Unarchive channel to unarchive the current channel."
msgstr "현재 채널을 보관 해제하려면 채널 보관 해제를 탭하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/archive-unarchive-channels.rst:110
msgid ""
"Alternatively, system admins can unarchive channels :ref:`via the mmctl "
"<administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl channel "
"unarchive>`, and Team admins can unarchive channels `via the API "
"<https://api.mattermost.com/#operation/RestoreChannel>`__."
msgstr ""
"또는 시스템 관리자는 :ref:`mmctl을 통해 <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-"
"command-line-tool:mmctl channel unarchive>` 채널을 보관 해제할 수 있으며, 팀 "
"관리자는 `API를 통해 <https://api.mattermost.com/#operation/RestoreChannel>`__ "
"채널을 보관 해제할 수 있습니다."

